.TH TEXT_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_init \- Engine\-internal: initialize SDL_ttf when EngineConfig.text is set
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "bool text_init(void);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Engine\-internal: initialize SDL_ttf when EngineConfig.text is set. Called by engine_init(); games never call it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on success.
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
